  "title": "Strong AI and weak AI",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "f558c368-f412-4451-bd53-0a1a3258fd24",
      "text": "Weak AI holds that the computer is a powerful tool for studying the mind. Strong AI holds that an appropriately programmed computer really is a mind, literally understanding and having other cognitive states, so that its programs are themselves explanations of human cognition.",
